# ~/.zshrc.local on a Linux box (Raspberry Pi, Proxmox guest). Never committed.
# Start empty. Add only what is specific to this machine, e.g.:
#   - container runtime (docker vs podman)
#   - a hostname-coloured prompt override, so ssh sessions are obvious
#   - paths for whatever this box serves (game servers, homelab tooling)
#
# uv, nvim and zellij come from packages/linux.sh into ~/.local/bin, which
# common.zsh already puts on PATH.
